  "id": 17,
  "description": "## 💀 Forgotten Canaglificio 💀\n\n### Discord is mandatory to join the guild.\n\n## Main guild\n🥉 No. 3 in seasonal rankings for Season 4!\n\n🥇 NO. 1 IN SEASONAL RANKINGS FOR SEASON 5!\n\n\nWe are a semi-hardcore guild that focuses on fun &amp; steady progression over 6 guilds!\n\nWe offer an active leadership and plan on being around for a long time. If you&#039;re an active player looking for a fair guild to progress with we&#039;d love to have you!\n\n### ✨ Features\n- Self-made **world boss timer** via discord\n- Guild armory\n- Active discord chat\n- Dynamic raid/pool to accommodate citadel bosses\n\n### ✔️ Requirements\n- Minimum combat level 92 (If below, Join our med-level guild - Forgotten Watch, or if a new player join Forgotten Dawn or Order.\n- Participate in raids.\n- Be active - Inactive players are kicked unless you notify us prior absence on discord!\n- Help fulfill guild challenges!\n\n### 📅 Daily Schedule\n- **17:00 PM CEST** (Level 92 raid)\n- **19:00 PM CEST** (Level 92 raid)\n- Both times are dynamic for citadel bosses\n\n ### 💬 Discord\n- Discord is mandatory to join the guild. Please use the &#039;applications&#039; channel in discord to apply.\n- Discord server link: https://discord.gg/kCKdJmckxC\n\n ###  🏰 Other Forgotten Guilds\n- Forgotten Assault, Pool, Raid CL 100\n- Forgotten Watch CL 80 - 91\n- Forgotten Dawn CL 60 - 79\n- Forgotten Order CL 40 - 59\n- Slums Tavern (POOL GUILD)\n\n**Welcome to the Forgotten.**\nWe are recruiting! Simply apply to a Forgotten guild within your CL, if no spot is available apply in a lower level subsidiary.",
